# Build outputs are produced inside the image, never copied in: a stale local
# dist/ shipping instead of a fresh build is exactly the class of mistake a
# container is supposed to remove.
#
# The `**/` prefix is not decoration. A bare `dist` matches only the context
# root, so nested `packages/*/dist` would be copied in.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-web
**/dist-webview
**/dist-types
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.vsix

.git
.gitignore
docs
*.md
.DS_Store
.env
